{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本人氣動漫《吉伊卡哇》向來擅長以可愛造型俘虜粉絲，今次更換上充滿京都風情的傳統服飾！</p><p>為慶祝「吉伊卡哇MOGUMOGU本舖」京都伏見店開業3周年，官方於11月13日起推出全新紀念精品系列，讓吉伊卡哇、小八貓及兔兔化身舞伎及藝伎，穿上華麗和服</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:24:06.801462+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T10:00:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T10:17:26.055765+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T10:17:26.055765+00:00","content_hash":"db6d74269c79b89c95eb32a6444416bea5ac2449e9406768d048a032889f612a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}